setCctpDomain.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the relevant role
│  └── it should revert with AccessManagedUnauthorized
└── when caller has the relevant role
   ├── when the provided EVM chain ID is zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroChainId
   └── when the provided EVM chain ID is not zero
      ├── when the provided EVM chain ID is the Mainnet chain ID (1)
      │  └── it should revert with ProtectedChainId
      └── when the provided EVM chain ID is not the Mainnet chain ID
         ├── when the provided CCTP domain is the Mainnet CCTP domain (0)
         │  └── it should revert with ProtectedCctpDomain
         └── when the provided CCTP domain is not the Mainnet CCTP domain
            ├── it should associate the provided EVM chain ID and CCTP domain in contract storage
            ├── it should clean up any previous association involving either of them
            └── it should emit a CctpDomainRegistered event
